14
00:00:28,709 --> 00:00:30,168
all that web search, of course, takes up

15
00:00:30,168 --> 00:00:31,899
time. And if you know which knowledge

16
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,003
knowledge will matter, why not just give it

17
00:00:34,003 --> 00:00:36,106
to the agent? Don't make the agent search

18
00:00:36,106 --> 00:00:38,578
and guess. Give your agent and your model

19
00:00:38,675 --> 00:00:40,168
the agent you know it will need.

20
00:00:40,762 --> 00:00:42,994
That is really the way to think about this.

21
00:00:43,909 --> 00:00:46,221
It's easy to become lazy when working with a

22
00:00:46,221 --> 00:00:48,757
coding agent, but don't. Make sure you

23
00:00:48,773 --> 00:00:50,877
construct proper context, you give it the

24
00:00:50,877 --> 00:00:53,237
knowledge it needs, and don't make it guess

25
00:00:53,365 --> 00:00:55,468
or anything like that. And that is the huge

26
00:00:55,468 --> 00:00:57,989
advantage of knowledge skills like this one.

27
00:00:58,150 --> 00:00:59,929
Which typically should be local in a

28
